        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "9. The submissions made are contrary to the plan which has been sanctioned by the BBMP itself in as much as the plan which has been sanctioned in favor of the landlord of the petitioner indicates the road width is 24 mts."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "59de44742ff4413c92aec23ceb1d3073_39",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "If that be so, it was not permissible on part of the respondent to make his submission initially that the road width was less than 40 feet now it is 70 feet when the plan itself indicates it to be 24 mtr road which is more than 70 feet."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b544d88b46904bce9d756758db0b895b_40",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "10. Apart therefrom, a perusal of the plan which has been sanctioned would indicate that the ground floor has been sanctioned for commercial purposes and it is only the upper floors which had been sanctioned for residential purposes."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "12d52bffb23d49809995f3281cbe7225_41",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "If that be so, the respondent- NC: 2024:KHC:3742 BBMP could have taken action only against the upper floors though granted for residential purposes are now allegedly being used for commercial purposes and no action could have been initiated"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f2176801ba874ee59063e9d2a6838bd7_42",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. The manner in which the respondent officials have acted in the present matter would only indicate the disregard that they have for the rule of law, if not, for total absence of knowledge of applicable rules."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f94a187bb44a43efb893e0ca419c71ed_43",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "There have been consistent efforts made to mislead this Court by initially stating that the road width is 40 feet and subsequent to the 70 feet when the plan which had been sanctioned by the BBMP itself would indicate that the road width is"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "8a4e9f8c3489410ba8acf3be77b7a52e_44",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
